1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,765
W: Welcome to the Hatfield House.

2
00:00:02,420 --> 00:00:04,565
Have you had the opportunity to look over the menu?

3
00:00:05,150 --> 00:00:07,085
M: I have, but I'm not sure what to order.

4
00:00:07,625 --> 00:00:09,485
It's been several months since I dined here.

5
00:00:10,245 --> 00:00:11,125
What do you recommend?

6
00:00:11,475 --> 00:00:13,025
W: Why don't you try our newest item?

7
00:00:13,805 --> 00:00:17,305
You can get a pork chop with a baked potato and sautéed vegetables.

8
00:00:18,125 --> 00:00:20,250
I've had it before and highly recommend it.

9
00:00:20,765 --> 00:00:23,085
M: All right, I think I'll go with your suggestion.

10
00:00:23,350 --> 00:00:23,765
W: Excellent.

11
00:00:24,445 --> 00:00:28,385
In the meantime, would you care for a soup or salad as an appetizer?

12
00:00:28,385 --> 00:00:31,460
M: No thanks, but I would like some iced tea.

13
00:00:31,745 --> 00:00:34,425
W: Sure, I'll bring you a glass in a couple of minutes.
